README.md

# Unity builds reach the container through the web/content bind mount, so with
# docker compose there is no reason to bake them into the image as well.
#
# IMPORTANT for ECS/Fargate: there is no bind mount there. Comment this line out
# before building an image for Fargate, or the games will 404 in production.
web/content/games/*/build/
